	(text_box "• Electrical Specs: 1.0 A max per pin | 50 V AC/DC | AWG 26-30\n• Mechanical Retention: Active positive lock (latch click) with high vibration resistance\n• Form Factor: Low-profile 1.25 mm pitch SMT | Dual solder reinforcement tabs\n• Application Scope: Differential RS-485, UART debug, encoder inputs & limit switches (not for motor power)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 182.9578 0)
		(size 142.24 10.0822)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3500400c-db65-4e28-90a1-c70786e863c3")
	)
	(text_box "• Specs: 15 A cont. (30 A peak) | Gold-plated (< 0.8 mΩ)\n• Keying & Fit: Polarized keyed | Low-profile right-angle mount\n• Interface: Anti-vibration friction lock | 2S-4S LiPo standard"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 102.87 0)
		(size 76.2 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b20a730-6e29-45f5-b837-df24f6aadcb6")
	)
	(text_box "• Technology: 4-channel bidirectional ESD protection array (USON-10 flow-through package)\n• Electrical Specs: V_RWM = 5.5 V | V_BR ≥ 6.5 V | I_off = 100 nA max (no VCC/VBUS pin required)\n• Parasitic Capacitance: C_IO ≈ 0.5 pF (ultra-low load preserving fast SPI SCK & I²C rise times)\n• ESD Level: ±12 kV Contact Discharge, ±15 kV Air-Gap (IEC 61000-4-2 Level 4)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 59.69 0)
		(size 104.14 10.0822)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a098c52d-92ba-4048-930a-473c4f3ea22f")
	)
	(text_box "• ON (Pin 1 - NC): Pulled HIGH to VIN via 510 kΩ (Normal operation)\n• OFF (Pin 3 - GND): Pulls SHDN_EXT LOW (< 0.4 V), disabling input MOSFETs (< 10 µA sleep)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
